 "text": "OpenAI just took Replit from Claude. Replit CEO set it on stage at TechCrunch Disrupt. OpenAI is now the default model inside Replit. His reasons? Cost, partnership, performance. He even said ChatGPT is better now. But this isn't a knockout. You can still pick Claude and Replit. It's just not the default anymore, and most people never change the default. So round one goes to OpenAI. Round two, Anthropic just launched Claude Duet. Who takes the next round? Comment AI and I'll send you my free AI starter pack."
